[00:18.69] There rides the rainbow demon
[00:24.07] 
[00:38.75] On his horse of crimson fire.
[00:43.09] Black shadows are following closely
[00:46.42] On the heels of his desire.
[00:52.54] 
[00:59.58] Riding on in the mist of morning
[01:04.54] 
[01:11.33] Noone dared to stand in his way.
[01:14.68] Posessed by some distant calling.
[01:19.85] Riding on through night and day.
[01:25.51] 
[01:30.73] Rainbow demon - Pick up your heart and run.
[01:40.21] 
[01:46.87] Rainbow demon - Looks for his sword and is gone.
[01:56.04] 
[02:13.68] Riding on in the mist of morning
[02:17.75] Noone dared to stand in his way.
[02:21.26] Posessed by some distant calling.
[02:25.66] Riding on through night and day.
